Cell["Case 1B - Original DAE", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"10e52a85-d4d7-724a-a482-3213f51a822f"],

Cell["\<\
Original seven-state DAE; all four terminal PMU quantities are included as \
known-value equations. This computes an ordinary commuting-polynomial Smith \
form at one exact DAE-consistent equilibrium, not a general noncommutative \
Jacobson form.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5952ba8d-067e-b145-81b6-6ce4e2cda735"],

